---
// Stylized run of triage.py. Ticket keys are illustrative; the flow matches the script.
---

<div class="win term" aria-label="Example run: tickets fetched by JQL, incomplete ones flagged and commented on">
  <div class="bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span><em>triage.py</em></div>
  <div class="body">
    <p><b>$</b> python triage.py</p>
    <p class="d">JQL status = "To Do" · 3 tickets</p>
    <p class="d">local LLM → JSON checks</p>
    <p><i class="no">✗</i> SEC-41 missing business justification</p>
    <p class="d sub">↳ commented to reporter, moved to In Progress</p>
    <p><i class="ok">✓</i> SEC-42 ready for manual review</p>
    <p><i class="no">✗</i> SEC-43 missing technical details</p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .term .body {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .term p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text);
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }
  .term b {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .term .d {
    color: var(--dim);
  }
  .term .sub {
    padding-left: 1.3em;
  }
  .term i {
    font-style: normal;
    margin-right: 6px;
  }
  .ok {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .no {
    color: #f87171;
  }
</style>
